              "expr": {
                "Literal": {
                  "Value": "'Column chart of the median revenue-to-budget multiple by budget band, over the credible set only: listings with a budget of at least $10,000 and revenue above zero. Bands below that floor are excluded, because a listing under the floor cannot support a money claim at all. The finding is stated in the sentence above the chart, which names the best and worst band and is computed from the data rather than typed.'"
